   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "One more line: the «and»",
   "texto": [
    "If you add a rayite to a vowel, you put a «and» in front of it: h( a) → **ㅑ (ya)**, h( h) → **ㅕ (yŏ)**, h( o) → **ㅛ (yo)**, h( u) → **ㅠ (yu)**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "«e» and combined vowels",
   "texto": [
    "The two of them today sound the same: **e**. Con «y»: ㅒ y ㅖ = **ye**.",
    "The vowels are also combined: - + hp = **ㅘ (wa)**, - + hp = **ㅝ (wŏ)**, - + hp = **ㅟ (wi)**.",
    "The three **we** rings.",
    "- Is: **ŭi**, said quickly."
   ]
